{
  "slug": "draft-pm-brain",
  "name": "Draft Pm Brain",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "This keeps context and priorities dynamically loaded into the agent and keeps priorities, product changes, and more up to date through conversations.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills**, **4 agents** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `draft-add-dimension` (Scaffold a new context dimension), `draft-compact` (Curator-triggered context compaction), `draft-connect` (Connect integrations to the Draft daemon), `draft-import` (Import markdown content from a local directory or private GitHub repo into the active workspace), `draft-learn` (DEPRECATED — use /draft:synthesize instead), `draft-load-team` (Pulls the latest team context from the shared GitHub repo directly into the local context/ directory), `draft-profiles` (Profile lifecycle management for Draft), `draft-publish-team` (Publishes the curator's local context to the shared GitHub repo), and 5 more\n- **Agents** (4): `draft-agent` (Main Draft orchestrator), `draft-executor` (Takes concrete actions), `draft-learner` (Context write engine for the Draft orchestrator), `draft-researcher` (Finds and retrieves information)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install draft-pm-brain@claude-community` from `idodekerobo/draft-cli-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
